Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.22,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.47,0:21:20.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:27.31,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.77,0:21:31.02,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.02,0:21:33.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.82,0:21:36.78,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.07,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.20,0:21:42.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.83,0:21:47.70,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.21,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.33,0:21:57.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.55,0:22:03.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.18,0:22:09.98,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.98,0:22:12.31,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.44,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.44,0:22:21.40,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.53,0:22:25.53,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.58,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.50,0:22:39.26,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
